---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.jsx';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions | AstroWheel – Free AI Astrologer">
  <head>
    <meta name="description" content="Read AstroWheel's terms and conditions for using our free AI Vedic astrologer service. By spinning the wheel you agree to these guidelines." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://freeastrologer.online/terms" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://freeastrologer.online/"},
        {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Terms & Conditions", "item": "https://freeastrologer.online/terms"}
      ]
    }
    </script>
  </head>
  <div class="min-h-screen text-[#f0eef7] flex flex-col font-sans">
    <header class="w-full border-b border-white/10 py-4 bg-[#07070b]/80 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-50">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
        <a href="/" class="text-2xl font-display font-bold bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-[#e8b866] to-[#cf9a67]">AstroWheel</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="flex-1 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-display font-bold mb-8">Terms & Conditions</h1>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#7d7c8e] leading-relaxed">
        <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> January 1, 2026</p>
        
        <p>
          Welcome to AstroWheel. These terms and conditions outline the rules and regulations for the use of AstroWheel's Website, operated by Artificial Grrow.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl text-white font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing this website we assume you accept these terms and conditions. Do not continue to use AstroWheel if you do not agree to take all of the terms and conditions stated on this page.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl text-white font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">2. Entertainment Purposes Only (Disclaimer)</h2>
        <p>
          The content, readings, and astrological insights provided on AstroWheel are generated using Artificial Intelligence and are intended <strong>strictly for entertainment purposes only</strong>. AstroWheel and Artificial Grrow do not guarantee the accuracy, reliability, or truthfulness of any generated reading or prediction. 
        </p>
        <p>
          Astrology is not a substitute for professional advice. Any decisions made based on the insights provided by our AI Astrologer—including financial, medical, legal, or personal life decisions—are made solely at your own risk. Always consult a qualified professional for serious matters.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl text-white font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">3. User Conduct</h2>
        <p>
          You agree to use this website only for lawful purposes and in a way that does not infringe the rights of, restrict or inhibit anyone else's use and enjoyment of the website. Prohibited behavior includes harassing or causing distress or inconvenience to any other user, transmitting obscene or offensive content, or disrupting the normal flow of dialogue within our application.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl text-white font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">4. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
        <p>
          Unless otherwise stated, Artificial Grrow and/or its licensors own the intellectual property rights for all material on AstroWheel. All intellectual property rights are reserved. You may access this from AstroWheel for your own personal use subjected to restrictions set in these terms and conditions.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl text-white font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall Artificial Grrow, nor any of its officers, directors, and employees, be held liable for anything arising out of or in any way connected with your use of this Website. Artificial Grrow shall not be held liable for any indirect, consequential, or special liability arising out of or in any way related to your use of this Website.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl text-white font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">6. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any queries regarding any of our terms, please contact us at <a href="mailto:sanyam.karnavat5@gmail.com" class="text-[#8b7bff] hover:underline">sanyam.karnavat5@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </div>
</Layout>
